{"candidateAnswer":"It had some mechanical issues and needed repairs","evidence":"[D11:1 | 6:13 pm on 10 April, 2023] John: Hey Maria, haven't talked for a few days. Had a wild week, my car broke down last Fri on my way to work. Trying to get it fixed but it's tough & putting a strain on my wallet. Staying positive & looking for a solution though.\n[D4:2 | 7:06 pm on 9 January, 2023] John: Hey Maria, I've been busy with work and family, but last week I had an unexpected incident on my way home. It reminded me how life can throw unexpected troubles our way.","itemId":"urn:uuid:51bb474b-c3f2-57c7-86e9-60eae705a391","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c378c1fefdf52e7f82f9505e2a256a3d8fa8516b3d19503e2c6b1ac4eb290090","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What damages have happened to John's car?","referenceAnswer":"Broken windshield, Car broke down","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c378c1fefdf52e7f82f9505e2a256a3d8fa8516b3d19503e2c6b1ac4eb290090"}}]}